  "serverOnlyNote": [
    "Cases below have NO form-core counterpart — the browser constrains these by UI affordance",
    "(you cannot click an option that isn't rendered) rather than by a validator, so there is",
    "nothing to be in parity WITH. They run in the Java test only. This is exactly the class of",
    "tampering the client cannot defend against, which is why the server checks it.",
    "",
    "Membership is SKIPPED when the field declares a dataSource: those options are fetched from a",
    "minion at fill time and are not in the schema, so the server has no list to check against."
  ],
